# This file previously contained a hardcoded RSA private key.
# The key has been removed for security reasons.
#
# To provide a TLS private key, use one of:
#   1. Set the TLS_KEY environment variable with the PEM-encoded key content
#   2. Set the TLS_KEY_PATH environment variable pointing to an external key file
#
# The private key that was stored here must be rotated (revoked/reissued)
# because it remains in git history.
